Comment: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Comment: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
