Comment: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Comment: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Comment: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Comment: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Comment: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Comment: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Comment: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Comment: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Truly, truly,
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Fifth Episode\NThe Weapon of Death\NChase the Airship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm faster than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, that looks like fun! Want to try it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:02:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.91,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get past you, Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the brake! Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.73,0:03:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you stop this thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look right here! Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. This is from that hit-and-run carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with a hit-and-run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, if we hadn't treated you in time, you would've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, the hit-and-run driver got away. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll definitely catch 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, if we use this metal piece dropped by the carriage as a clue,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we can definitely catch them. Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sapphire. I'm gonna punch that guy! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out of here, you brat!\N- No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could buy medicine with a measly ten yen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you complete and total idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten yen is all I have, you stupid, stupid, stingy idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven, I'm sorry for talking bad about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Sapphire! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, why did you come to buy medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a rabbit and a raccoon dog got hit by a carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a scary black carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A black carriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Those poor things...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know anything about the black carriage that hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know whose carriage it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but it passes through the northern forest every day around this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The northern forest? {\i1}All right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely passes through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? These fallen leaves haven't been stepped on yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means it hasn't passed by yet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the forest behind the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange. Even people from the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't supposed to use this back gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who this cloaked man is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! Open up! I said open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you brat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Open this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But someone dressed in black just went in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody went in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I clearly saw someone go in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! I said open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Open up! Open the door, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You refuse to open it? Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't move from here until you do! I won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So that man really was the hit-and-run culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had no idea there were stairs like this here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't know there was a secret corridor here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope no one saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Duralumin's henchmen...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone's coming!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who could it be?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here with warm wishes for His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder what Father is secretly discussing with those guys.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he's with Duralumin and that hit-and-run driver,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I hope it's nothing bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Your Majesty. I'll deliver it as soon as it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.13,0:09:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I shall take my leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:09:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you discussing with the King and Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're another spy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to pry into the new weapon I invented!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no spy! I'm a friend of the old man you hit and ran!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was you from back then! Persistent bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit-and-run coward! I'll teach you a lesson for that old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting all fancy, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.79,0:10:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you running away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:10:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a taste of my new weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of better weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one of my inventions—the Birdlime Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward! Stop using such weird tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle all you want. I'm a busy man. So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Are you running away? You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Birdlime, huh? This should come off easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! There's grape juice in this barrel! It might dissolve the birdlime!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Just as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Lord Sapphire! This area is off-limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shorty! Which way did the black carriage go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff really stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I splashed it onto that black carriage, so if we follow the scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll track them down for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come pretty deep into the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking so long... I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be inside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you open this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't budge at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to look for a way in from the top of the mountain, Shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the ceiling hatch for the test flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the upper hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally made a deal with the King and Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to buy this flying battleship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, if I do say so myself, this flying battleship turned out splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... so what Father was talking to Duralumin about was buying this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, what a terrifying new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's punish that hit-and-run jerk, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right! We're gonna smash that terrifying new weapon to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparation complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, release the steam to blind the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it if you dare! This brat's life is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, forget about me! Just get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry up and let Shorty go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of that brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.91,0:16:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, cut the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Starboard clear, course set, engines running smooth... Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"Steady as she goes" my ass, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you like riding a flying battleship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this thing such a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream while you can. Once we get higher,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drop you and squash you flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Squash me flat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and cry while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right then, looks like we've hit just the right altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's high! Dropping from this high up, you've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is where you get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.78,0:17:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally caught up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I was waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a persistent pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shorty, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's no bird! No, wait... that's a flying ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The flying battleship you ordered is complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at its magnificent form!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire? What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shorty and I caught the hit-and-run driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what's gotten into you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Having such an evil man build a terrifying new weapon like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Lord Sapphire?! This man is a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, he built this incredible new weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, no country can defeat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How can someone who makes killing machines be a genius?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Majesty, pay no mind to a child's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, quickly set this genius free and pay him as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If there isn't enough in the treasury, collect taxes to cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards! We won't forgive you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if you squeeze taxes out of us poor folks just to buy a monster like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but national defense is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be attacked at any time. We need superior weapons, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Having this won't make Silverland any stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Other countries are bound to make even more powerful weapons, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! This is no time to listen to a child, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough! Even if you ask now, I won't sell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,, I'll go sell it to another country!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Silverland is buying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool! Untie me! Untie me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I'm never untying you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Untie the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Untie the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No! We can't let another country get that flying battleship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you actually hung me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Fire... H-Hey, someone put it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.78,0:22:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If it catches fire, it's all over!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.37,0:22:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Grandpa, that hit-and-run bastard died. Go easy on him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, what a waste. What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.07,0:22:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Having such a terrifying new weapon won't make us strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Other nations will surely create something even more terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, even without new weapons, I will protect Silverland. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.83,0:23:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing you say that makes me ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to work harder to build a better kingdom for everyone to live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.83,0:23:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help me, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.81,0:23:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! I'll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We'll all work together!
